    "政策更新與聯絡方式": "Policy Updates and Contact",
    "Wei's Portfolio（以下稱「本網站」）重視您的隱私。本政策說明您瀏覽作品、提交拍攝詢問、切換語言或使用客戶交圖專區時，可能涉及哪些資料、使用目的、第三方服務及您可採取的選擇。": "Wei's Portfolio (the \"Site\") respects your privacy. This policy explains the data involved when you browse the portfolio, submit a photography inquiry, change languages, or use a client gallery, as well as why it is used, which third parties may process it, and the choices available to you.",
    "本政策適用於本網站所提供的頁面與功能；當您前往 Instagram 或其他外部網站後，資料處理方式將依該服務自己的隱私權政策辦理。": "This policy applies to pages and features provided by the Site. Once you follow a link to Instagram or another external service, that service's own privacy policy governs its processing.",
